WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.310
Last time on...

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.730
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.690
Aye, aye!

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.480
Running out of time to stop the school merger,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.230
Aqours decided to try the formation
the previous Aqours couldn't master.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.280
That may be the only answer after all.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.360
However, it was more difficult
than we ever imagined.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.700
But with everyone rooting
for Chika-<i>chan</i>, she finally...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.450
Don't do this because
you think you owe it to all of us.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.890
We are all excited...

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:27.290
...about being able to find our own shine
together with you, Chika-<i>chan</i>.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:40.470
Well, everyone! We're now going
to announce the Love Live finalists!

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.380
Three groups can proceed to the final round.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:55.420
Please!

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.740
"Uchikinton"

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:01.490
These are the top three groups!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.080
Chika-<i>chan</i>!

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.580
Did we... Did we really do it?

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.590
This isn't a dream, is it?
It's not like I'm about to wake up, right?

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.200
Nope!

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:20.120
Really? We're talking about
the final round! The dome!

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:22.540
If this is really happening, it's a miracle!

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:26.560
It <i>is</i> a miracle. We caused a miracle.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:27.580
Yeah.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.560
All right! Here we go!

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:32.320
Full speed ahead!

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.280
Aye, aye!

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.990
And salute!

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:52.290
<i>Let's throw our all at each other</i>
<i>and grab hold of the future!</i>

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:02.720
<i>The sky and this ocean are both on our side</i>

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:06.770
<i>Shining and saying, "Go, do your best!"</i>

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:13.520
<i>To let our voices reach far, far away</i>

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:18.450
<i>Shall we shout our dreams louder?</i>

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.280
<i>(Full of hope)</i>

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:24.580
<i>Today pulls tomorrow toward itself</i>

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:33.040
<i>It's really fun to grasp the magnet</i>
<i>in my heart and run right now!</i>

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:35.340
<i>(Let's always go together)</i>

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.130
<i>What shall we do about the future?!</i>

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:45.930
<i>Everyone laughs and cries</i>
<i>as</i> <i>they</i> <i>look for the shape of their dreams</i>

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:54.480
<i>Because I'm sure the</i> <i>future</i> <i>us</i>
<i>will have the answer</i>

00:02:54.480 --> 00:03:02.490
<i>Let's run with everything we have</i>
<i>and become the shining wind</i>

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.840
<i>We got dream</i>

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:11.830
I was so nervous that
I couldn't eat anything, <i>zura</i>.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.060
You were eating the whole time!

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:15.790
In any case, Akiba Dome, huh?

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:17.460
"#7 'The Time Left'"

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.790
<i>Noppo</i> is a different story, <i>zura</i>.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.460
There are ten more <i>Noppo</i>.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.800
I wonder what that place is like.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.080
What?!

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.880
I want to make a great song!

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.740
Let's make our dance
even more energetic.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:26.140
<i>Can we do it? (Hi!) We can! (Hi!)</i>

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:25.800
Look!

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:30.140
<i>My heart crying out</i>
<i>(and the shine it craves)</i>

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:28.960
Check out all the views it's gotten!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.350
"Love Live! Tokai Regional Prelims"
"Aqours, Number of Views"

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.440
<i>Will prove it right before your eyes</i>

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:35.980
You're right...
So many people have viewed it.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:36.190
<i>Can we do it...</i>

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.450
Considering the difference in the
number of students, that's just expected.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:46.700
This many people have watched
and rooted for us.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.450
Ah! Then, the number of
the prospective students too must be...

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:56.500
What's wrong?

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.220
No way...

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:58.420
Don't tell me...

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:02.130
I'm sure it's just that my cell froze up, right?

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.680
The number was going up yesterday.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.840
There's no way that it didn't change at all.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:11.810
The time limit given by
Mari-<i>chan</i>'s dad is tonight, right?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:15.300
It'll be okay. There's still some time.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:18.610
We'll know the exact number
if we go to school, right?

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:19.940
Yeah.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:21.610
Okay, then!

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.030
Let's go back!

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:31.020
Hold on a sec.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:35.460
How does it look?

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.960
"Applications (For staff's eyes only)"
"Number of Applicants: 80"

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:40.960
It hasn't changed.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.420
Oh no...

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:45.360
Don't tell me the celestial
sphere is interfering?!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.550
Then it really is...

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:48.850
We have only four hours left.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.430
What's going on with
the view count for Aqours?

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.440
It's been going up all this time.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.060
I'll go call my dad.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.360
It's taking a while...

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.110
It's early morning there.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.330
She may be having a hard time getting him.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:12.660
Sorry I kept you waiting.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.660
Were you able to talk to your dad?

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.710
Yeah, I told him that

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:21.420
we're going to the final round
and the view count is going crazy.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.170
And...?

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.930
She managed to get an extension
until tomorrow morning.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.430
But it'll only be until five a.m. Japan time.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.640
If we can't get a hundred
applicants by then,

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.930
they'll close down the application page.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:38.440
So this is the final notice, huh?

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:42.360
But we now have eight hours when
we only had three hours left earlier.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.300
Ah!

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.820
We just got one more person!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.820
"Number of Applicants: 86"

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:50.450
She must've become interested
after watching us.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.030
If it keeps going up at this rate...

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.790
Hey, where're you going?!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.330
The train station!

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.670
I'll ask people to support Uranohoshi
in front of the station!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.900
Then... Then... Um...

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.420
We can't do it this late.

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:07.010
Then, let's do a concert!
We'll stream it on the internet, and...

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.470
Morning will be here
before we're done preparing for it.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.010
Oh, I know!

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.380
Calm down.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:14.970
It's okay. It's okay.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:17.640
But I can't just do nothing.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.810
We just have to believe
in our performance today.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:32.530
I guess you're right.
That many people watched us.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:34.650
We should be okay, right?

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:39.330
Now that that's settled,
please go home, everyone.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.830
Going home, <i>zura</i>?

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.210
I feel like I'll get stressed out
if I'm by myself.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.920
Yeah, we can't relax
because we're so anxious.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:46.880
You heard them.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.670
Well I guess it can't be helped then.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.550
Then it's okay to stay?

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:55.180
If you can get permission from your families
as well as from our director...

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.380
Of course! Let's see this through together.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:59.560
Ah!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.720
We got another one!

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:09.530
It hasn't gone up at all since the last one.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.530
"Number of Applicants: 87"

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.620
I bet this computer really is messed up!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:17.080
Stop it. It's not broken.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.290
This is reality.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.580
Even though so many people
came to know the name of Uranohoshi...

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.880
Even though our town is pretty
and people are kind,

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.730
not many people would go so far
as to attend school here.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:35.620
Come to think of it,
we haven't eaten anything since lunch.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.980
Seriously, do we have to
do everything for them?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.900
I already have my hands full
with my little demons, you know.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.360
It can't be helped, <i>zura</i>.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:50.940
Chika-<i>chan</i> and the other two second-years
started the current Aqours.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:56.120
And my sis and the other two third-years
started the previous Aqours.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.490
They feel responsible, <i>zura</i>.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:01.380
They don't have to.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:05.450
As far as I'm concerned,
I have nothing but gratitude...

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:14.760
I-I only joined Aqours
to get more little demons.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:18.720
So we take care of them, <i>zura</i>.
That's what friends are for, <i>zura</i>.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:19.850
Yeah.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.580
That's kinda nice.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.110
It feels like we're supporting each other.

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:30.020
Yeah, it does, <i>zura</i>!

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:39.480
As a reward for saying something nice,
I'll give you a <i>mochi-kinchaku</i>.

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.750
What? I'd rather have a dark <i>hanpen</i>, <i>zura</i>.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.160
Oh, that you can't have.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.330
I want an egg!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.580
Err, you can't have that, either.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.460
Ninety-four...

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:51.760
We need six more.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.010
"Number of Applicants: 94"

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.510
How much time is left?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.160
Less than an hour.

00:08:58.760 --> 00:08:59.810
Please!

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.470
Please!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:06.600
Please! Please! Please! Please!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.520
Please...! Go up!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.480
Chika-<i>chan</i>...

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.440
"Number of Applicants: 94"

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:23.450
"Director"

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.740
Even You-<i>chan</i> can't fight off sleep, huh?

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.450
I'm not asleep.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:27.870
But waiting is making me kinda tired.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.380
Oopsy-daisy.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.090
Argh...

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.560
We need six more! Please!

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.300
Please!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:47.260
Hey!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:53.250
Uranohoshi is a good school!

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.490
Hey!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:59.410
You'll never regret coming here!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:03.780
The students are all nice!

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:11.530
I guarantee it!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.840
She gave them a guarantee.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.880
You can bank on my guarantees.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:21.550
Chika-<i>chan</i>!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:22.930
Come!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.770
"Number of Applicants: 97"

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.770
Three more!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.980
But we're running out of time.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:30.610
Please!

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:33.560
Please!

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.360
Ninety-eight!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.740
And the time?

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.910
It'll be fine. I'll be fine.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.290
"Number of Applicants: 98"

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.290
I'm sure it'll reach a hundred.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:47.960
It'll be fine.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.120
It will make it...!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.570
It will make it!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.400
It will make it!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.220
"Number of Applicants: 98"

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.720
"Applications Closed"

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.820
Applications closed...?

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.390
We ran out of time.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:10.060
No... It'll be okay.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.310
If we have one more day...
no, a half day is fine.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:14.730
Even an hour would do.

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.610
That'll definitely be enough.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:17.940
We promised.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.860
But we just need a little more time...

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:20.930
She's right.

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:24.910
We don't need a whole lot of time. 
Just one more day.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:30.140
We did talk to him many times.
We talked to him over and over all night.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:35.090
But he already gave us two extensions.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:40.050
Even my dad doesn't have the authority
to decide on everything himself.

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:42.380
He said he did everything he could.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.550
But if it's just one more day...

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:46.350
We were able to get extensions before.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:49.890
They've started the process
to merge the schools by now.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.020
Then...

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.250
This is really it?

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:05.200
It can't end like this...
because we haven't struggled yet.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.200
We promised that we'd struggle
as hard as we could.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.330
We said that we'd do everything we could!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:15.710
We did, and we're going to the final round.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.570
We did everything we could.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:23.700
Chika!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.390
Then why is our school going to be closed?

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.260
Why can't we protect our school?

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:35.900
That's... That's...

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:38.480
Don't.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.780
I'll try calling my dad just one last time.

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:44.990
If we keep asking,
you will be let go as the director.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:46.910
We have no choice but to accept it.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.410
Our school...

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.580
will be gone.

00:12:57.600 --> 00:13:00.380
Uranohoshi Girls' High School will be merged

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:03.760
"Notice of School Merger"

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:03.760
with a high school in Numazu next year.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:08.850
I want you all to live a cheerful,
energetic high school life

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:12.930
at your new school next spring.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.130
Chika-<i>chan</i>.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:18.900
Chika-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.360
We have to switch classrooms.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.610
Ah, that's right.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:23.860
Chika!

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:27.410
You guys really made it
to the final round of Love Live!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.990
Continue what you're doing
and leave the other groups in the dust!

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.520
Let us hear another good song!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:33.690
Okay.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:35.620
It'll be at Akiba Dome.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:39.080
You'll have to really move around
so that everyone can see.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:43.340
We'll cheer loudly so that you can hear us.

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:45.800
Chika-<i>chan</i>...

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:49.500
That's right! We'll do our best to win!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:52.540
Jeez... You scared us there.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.850
Let's focus on what's ahead for now.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.270
Love Live isn't over yet.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.220
I know.

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:07.360
It's unfortunate that our school
will merge with another,

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.740
but Love Live won't wait for us.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.780
Let's forget what happened
up until yesterday.

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.250
Let's get a fresh start today
and work hard to win the final round!

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:20.580
Of course! It'll be in a den of evil
with 55,000 little demons waiting for me!

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.640
Yeah, waiting to see your bad
comedy routine, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>, <i>zura</i>.

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:24.550
It's Yohane!

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:31.930
A-Also... for my sis... for the third-years,
this will be their last Love Live.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.390
So... So...

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:36.140
I want us to win no matter what!

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:37.280
Ruby...

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.560
Yes! Then we're gonna win!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.060
It's not that easy, you know.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:42.860
But...

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:47.120
We have to believe that we can!

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.660
Yep. Let's win!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.580
Okay then, everyone! Start warming up!

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:56.000
Since we just performed yesterday,
do it thoroughly!

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.660
Yeah!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:01.060
Then, let's stretch. Ready...

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:04.840
One, two, three, four.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:06.130
Yeah. I guess I'll just
focus on Love Live now.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:08.260
Two, two, three, four.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.640
Three, two, three, four.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:15.560
Four, two, three, four.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.520
One, two, three, four...

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:19.180
"Number of Applicants: 98"

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:20.160
"Number of Applicants: 98"

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:20.440
"Applications Closed"

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:24.650
Chika-<i>chan</i>?

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:31.740
Chika-<i>chan</i>...

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.180
Chika...

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.210
What's wrong...?

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:43.580
Guys...?

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:48.050
Shall we just not practice today?

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.960
What? Why?

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:51.260
I'm all right.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:54.510
I'm sorry. I thought we should
focus on what's ahead

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.680
even if we had to force ourselves.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:58.560
But feelings don't really
work like that, do they?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.390
That's not really true.
Ruby-<i>chan</i> was saying it, too.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:05.130
This will be the last performance for you guys.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.070
And... And...

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.450
It's not just you, Chika.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:09.110
What?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.490
Everyone else feels the same.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:17.740
You actually think that
we can all let go just like that?

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:23.840
I think we should take some time
to think after all...

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:28.250
About whether we should really perform
in the Love Live final round, or...

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.680
I think she's right.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:45.140
W-Wait. Of course we're going to perform!

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.770
This is the final round!
This will be the third-years'...

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:49.650
Do you really feel that way?

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.940
Ask yourself.

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:57.090
Not just Chika-<i>chi</i>. Everyone, ask yourself.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:13.840
<i>When things don't go my way</i>

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:19.840
<i>And I feel like crying</i>

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.350
"Good luck with Love Live"

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:31.270
<i>I bite my lip and pray,</i>
<i>"Let tomorrow be sunny!"</i>

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.850
"Go for it!!" "Win Love Live"

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:37.030
<i>They seem like they'll connect,</i>
<i>but they don't</i>

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:41.910
<i>My heart and your heart</i>

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:47.370
<i>The boat crosses the sunset</i>

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.660
"Formation patterns"
"Win Love Live!"

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:53.800
<i>Carrying my worries away</i>

00:17:53.800 --> 00:18:05.560
<i>Shall I tell the disappearing waves</i>
<i>I can still keep trying?</i>

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:15.820
<i>Look, I'm fine now!</i>
<i>I'll run all the way home</i>

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:14.930
Morning!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.180
Morning!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:22.790
<i>I want to do something fun now</i>

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:20.120
Everyone came here after all.

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:21.200
Yep.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:25.080
This shows that everyone
feels the same way after all.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:34.770
<i>I have to tell you once I get home...</i>

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:27.960
I know that it'd be better
if we go and perform.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.580
But we couldn't save our school.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.170
And yet, we go to the final round and sing...

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.840
Even if we could win...

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:38.160
You're right.

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:44.850
But you guys didn't become
school idols just to save the school.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.810
To find our shine.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:51.410
To find the shine in every one of us.

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:52.480
But...

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.010
We can't find it...

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:58.440
...because our school
will be gone even if we win.

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:02.480
If we had caused a miracle
and saved our school,

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:04.580
we could've shined.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.880
We could've found our shine.

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.460
But we couldn't save our school...

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:12.460
I don't think that we'll be able
to find our shine!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:17.770
Right now, I don't care about Love Live.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:21.010
I don't care about our shine.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.470
I want to save our school!

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:26.220
The place where we spent
so much time together...

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.900
Then save it!

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:38.320
Then save it! Go perform in Love Live,

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.150
and win!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:41.970
Everyone...

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.910
If I could, I'd do it in a heartbeat!

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:47.750
If I could keep struggling together
with everyone, and...

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:48.750
And?

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:52.560
And keep our school alive...!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:58.920
Is that really the only way
you can save our school?!

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:02.220
We asked everyone in school

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:06.890
what they want you guys to do
and what would make them happy.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.480
Everyone said the same thing.

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:10.980
We want you to win Love Live!

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:16.800
Not just for your own sake,
but for our sake... and our school's!

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:20.190
We want you
to immortalize our school's name!

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:21.990
Our school's name...

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:26.820
You're our only hope! You guys
are the only ones who can do it!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:31.580
Aqours, the Uranohoshi
Girls' High School Idols!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:38.250
We want you to make that name
forever part of Love Live history!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:42.760
The name of Uranohoshi Girls'
High School together with Aqours'!

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:46.810
So... So... So...!

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:49.760
Shine!

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:54.270
By winning... our school's name will...

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.810
In Love Live...

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:00.400
Chika-<i>chan</i>.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.700
Do you wanna quit?

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.700
Do you wanna quit?

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:05.150
Why would I quit?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:09.180
Why would I?! Why would I?! Why would I?!

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:12.540
We will win! We won't just win,
we'll knock it out of the park!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.500
It doesn't matter who we're up against!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:17.420
The Akiba Dome... The final round...
None of that matters!

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.240
We will win!

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:23.020
We will win and leave our school's name
in Love Live history!

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:25.940
Let's make memories that will never fade!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:31.930
Yeah! We're all like,
"Hit us with everything you've got!"

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:35.350
But just watching them
somehow gets me fired up!

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:36.270
Yes, it does.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:40.020
All my little demons... The time
for the final battle is finally at hand.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.980
Descend together with Yohane!

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:44.570
Ahh! I need to let this energy out!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:45.780
Let's go for a run!

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:47.340
Now, let's go!

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:48.950
Me, too, <i>zura</i>?!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:49.980
Oh no!

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.240
Now, you, too, Riko-<i>san</i>!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:53.970
Chika-<i>chan</i>'s days of being
the normal monster may be over.

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:58.740
Her strength may now
rival that of... a real monster.

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:01.710
Hey, hold it!

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:03.670
Wait for me!

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:18.190
<i>Try and be brave</i>

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:20.730
<i>I know it's actually scary</i>

00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:26.740
<i>It's not like I was able</i>
<i>to</i> <i>do it from the start, either</i>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:29.570
<i>I messed up a lot</i>

00:22:29.570 --> 00:22:32.240
<i>I was really frustrated</i>

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:37.710
<i>But</i> <i>that</i> <i>gave</i> <i>me</i> <i>strength,</i>
<i>so</i> <i>just</i> <i>don't</i> <i>give</i> <i>up</i>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:43.500
<i>Tears</i> <i>in</i> <i>your</i> <i>eyes</i>
<i>that</i> <i>want</i> <i>to</i> <i>try</i> <i>believing</i>

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.760
<i>Say "bye-bye" to hesitation and tears</i>

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:49.430
<i>Now, let's go!</i>

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:54.600
<i>Let's chase them as</i> <i>many</i> <i>times</i>
<i>as it takes, don't lose</i>

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:57.930
<i>Everyone fails sometimes</i>

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:00.900
<i>But dreams won't fade, dreams won't fade</i>

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>Let's chase them as</i> <i>many</i> <i>times</i>
<i>as it takes, don't lose</i>

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:14.330
<i>'Cause today is today, and once</i>
<i>you</i> <i>wake up, it'll be a new morning</i>

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:22.330
<i>Oh, the sun's smiling down on you</i>

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:38.880
Next Time! "HAKODATE."

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:41.250
"#8 'HAKODATE'"
